WEBVTT

00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:11.710
I share my unstoppable curiosity with you.

00:00:13.790 --> 00:00:17.510
I'm still able to run through the fog...

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:21.200
...because I know that you're here for me.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:28.930
I guess the shape of happiness is different for everyone...

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:33.270
...however, I know it's boring when I'm alone...

00:00:33.690 --> 00:00:35.150
But, with you...

00:00:35.150 --> 00:00:37.230
...it's like a mystery!

00:00:39.070 --> 00:00:42.820
It's an enchanting future, where...

00:00:42.990 --> 00:00:47.460
...in order for me to be strong, it's always you...

00:00:47.472 --> 00:00:51.920
...that I can continue to depend on, right?

00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.500
Just to survive!

00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:55.460
Stumped Q? Don't lose your way!

00:00:55.460 --> 00:00:57.237
Take this moment...

00:00:57.248 --> 00:01:00.920
...to fix your gaze and charge on ahead!

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.130
Eternally, we'll always be together...

00:01:03.130 --> 00:01:04.970
...searching and pursuing...

00:01:04.970 --> 00:01:08.635
...the meaning of it all.

00:01:08.646 --> 00:01:10.810
Truth is nothing but a labyrinth...

00:01:10.810 --> 00:01:12.470
...that we try to continue through...

00:01:12.470 --> 00:01:16.190
...especially when we are hurt.

00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:18.360
I'll take you, so come this way.

00:01:18.360 --> 00:01:20.190
I'm certain that, on that day...

00:01:20.190 --> 00:01:24.110
...I'll see your smile, face to face!

00:01:39.725 --> 00:01:40.660
I'm home, mom!

00:01:41.127 --> 00:01:42.395
What’s for dinner today?

00:01:43.329 --> 00:01:45.431
Kyuu, you have a guest.

00:01:46.165 --> 00:01:47.133
A guest?

00:01:47.667 --> 00:01:50.870
She’s a real cutey, could she be…?

00:02:00.079 --> 00:02:02.315
It’s just my old classmate from
middle school, Ichinose!

00:02:04.150 --> 00:02:06.853
Ichinose! What’s up?

00:02:07.720 --> 00:02:08.521
Kyuu-kun…

00:02:09.388 --> 00:02:12.325
Actually, I have a favor to ask you…

00:02:15.061 --> 00:02:17.964
Oh, dear! We’re out of snacks!

00:02:18.297 --> 00:02:19.899
I'm go out and get some!

00:02:20.032 --> 00:02:22.001
H-Hey, wait! Mom!

00:02:28.040 --> 00:02:29.609
Uhm… What was it?

00:02:31.777 --> 00:02:36.449
I want you to come to the seance that’s
going to be held at my house.

00:02:37.083 --> 00:02:38.017
A seance?

00:02:38.017 --> 00:02:39.552
Yeah.

00:02:39.552 --> 00:02:43.656
It’s a ceremony where a spirit medium calls the
spirit of a someone who’s passed away…

00:02:43.956 --> 00:02:47.894
…and causes the spirit to speak and
write things down on paper, but…

00:02:48.427 --> 00:02:54.133
The truth is, a medium came to our house
and called on the spirit of my mother.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:56.802
Oh, that’s right. Your mother was…

00:02:57.336 --> 00:03:00.106
Yeah. She was killed in a plane
crash six months ago.

00:03:00.940 --> 00:03:04.410
But don’t you feel skeptical that
it was your mother’s spirit?

00:03:04.777 --> 00:03:09.515
Yeah. When we first met the medium,
we didn’t believe in her whatsoever…

00:03:10.349 --> 00:03:14.820
But she had a letter of request
in my mom’s handwriting.

00:03:15.354 --> 00:03:16.822
A letter of request…

00:03:17.256 --> 00:03:19.592
Yeah. My mother had written…

00:03:19.859 --> 00:03:26.165
"If anything happens to me, please ask Asakura
Kousei-san to recall my spirit."

00:03:27.500 --> 00:03:29.268
Was it really your mother’s handwriting?

00:03:29.535 --> 00:03:33.306
Yes. My brothers asked an expert to
perform a handwriting analysis.

00:03:33.472 --> 00:03:35.741
They said that they were sure
it was my mom’s handwriting.

00:03:37.276 --> 00:03:40.813
B-But, I… Ghosts and stuff…

00:03:41.647 --> 00:03:44.550
It’s not a ghost! It’s definitely a fraud!

00:03:44.550 --> 00:03:47.887
But…

00:03:47.887 --> 00:03:54.961
The medium claimed that she can reveal
the location where mom’s will is hidden.

00:03:55.661 --> 00:04:00.433
And everybody started to wonder if the will might
have new instructions about the inheritance.

00:04:01.067 --> 00:04:01.901
Ichinose…

00:04:03.603 --> 00:04:08.341
I have a bad feeling about this… I think
something bad is going to happen…

00:04:11.177 --> 00:04:13.579
That’s why I want you to come!

00:04:13.846 --> 00:04:18.484
You go to that famous Dan Detective
Academy, don’t you?

00:04:19.051 --> 00:04:20.019
W-Well, yeah…

00:04:20.886 --> 00:04:24.123
I want to you to uncover the tricks
used in the bogus seance.

00:04:24.357 --> 00:04:25.725
Please, I beg you!

00:04:32.999 --> 00:04:35.501
Oh, I'm sorry. Did I interrupt you?

00:04:36.135 --> 00:04:39.472
Ah! W-W-What are you talking about, Mom?

00:04:43.943 --> 00:04:47.213
And so the seance is going to be held this weekend.

00:04:48.447 --> 00:04:50.449
A bogus seance, eh?

00:04:50.916 --> 00:04:55.855
I'll pass. I don’t know much about
ghosts and that occult stuff.

00:04:55.855 --> 00:04:57.690
Yeah.

00:04:57.690 --> 00:05:00.693
I think we shouldn’t get too involved in this too.

00:05:01.894 --> 00:05:08.134
That is what I think too, but that medium may
be after Ichinose’s mother’s fortune.

00:05:08.868 --> 00:05:11.737
And so, let’s all work together
to uncover the fraud for her!

00:05:15.074 --> 00:05:16.876
What are you guys worried about?

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:21.580
Alright! This time it will just be me, Megu and Kyuu.

00:05:22.281 --> 00:05:23.082
Alright!

00:05:23.115 --> 00:05:26.118
E-Eh? H-Hey, why am I in it, too?

00:05:26.218 --> 00:05:28.587
It'll be okay. Let’s go, Megu!

00:05:29.622 --> 00:05:32.725
Shouldn’t we get Dan-sensei’s permission first?

00:05:33.459 --> 00:05:37.096
It is also a detective’s job to act before
something terrible happens.

00:05:39.031 --> 00:05:39.865
Dan-Sensei!

00:05:41.400 --> 00:05:45.871
I also smell something fishy about that medium
appearing before that family…

00:05:45.871 --> 00:05:50.609
…with a letter of request that the medium
claims their mother wrote.

00:05:50.776 --> 00:05:51.477
Y-You mean…

00:05:51.977 --> 00:05:52.678
Right.

00:05:53.746 --> 00:05:59.452
I want all of you students in class Q to attend this
"seance" this weekend at the Ichinose House.

00:05:59.952 --> 00:06:00.419
Understand?

00:06:06.659 --> 00:06:08.861
Well then, Nanami? You’re there, right?

00:06:09.595 --> 00:06:10.863
You spotted me.

00:06:11.797 --> 00:06:13.866
Go and assist Class Q.

00:06:14.834 --> 00:06:15.301
Yes, Sir.

00:06:15.901 --> 00:06:18.104
Leave the baby-sitting to me.

00:06:18.738 --> 00:06:22.241
I'll arrange it so that one of the people at the
seance will switch places with you, so…

00:06:22.775 --> 00:06:24.777
Disguise yourself and sneak into the meeting.

00:06:28.214 --> 00:06:30.950
Wow! This is one huge house!

00:06:31.684 --> 00:06:32.852
Really!

00:06:33.085 --> 00:06:34.019
Is it really?

00:06:35.321 --> 00:06:36.389
Kyuu-kun!

00:06:37.523 --> 00:06:38.924
I'm so glad you came!

00:06:40.292 --> 00:06:43.229
Thanks also to all you people
from the Detective Academy.

00:06:44.130 --> 00:06:45.431
I'm Ichinose Kaoru.

00:06:46.732 --> 00:06:48.467
Now, please come in.

00:06:50.436 --> 00:06:52.905
I see. She’s quite a cutey, Kyuu.

00:06:53.239 --> 00:06:56.675
He’s right. We don’t have that type of girl at DDS.

00:07:00.179 --> 00:07:04.650
Let’s go in! Don’t forget that we came
here under Dan-sensei’s orders!

00:07:06.752 --> 00:07:08.421
Eh? What’s with Megu?

00:07:09.088 --> 00:07:09.889
That was bad…

00:07:10.389 --> 00:07:11.724
It’s because you were saying something foolish.

00:07:12.224 --> 00:07:13.592
That was you!

00:07:14.093 --> 00:07:15.094
What’s she mad about?

00:07:16.929 --> 00:07:17.797
Come on, let’s go in.

00:07:18.264 --> 00:07:18.964
It’s because you praised that girl!

00:07:18.964 --> 00:07:20.366
No, it’s because you said there
isn’t that type of girl at DDS!
It’s because you praised that girl!

00:07:20.366 --> 00:07:21.434
No, it’s because you said there
isn’t that type of girl at DDS!

00:07:25.738 --> 00:07:27.640
Everybody’s gathered in this room.

00:07:28.340 --> 00:07:29.074
Sorry for intruding.

00:07:36.315 --> 00:07:37.316
Welcome.

00:07:38.284 --> 00:07:41.420
I understand you are all the young mistress’s
friends from the detective club.

00:07:42.087 --> 00:07:47.026
I am Ootaguro, the butler of the Ichinose residence.

00:07:47.493 --> 00:07:49.728
The detective club? Us?

00:07:55.134 --> 00:07:55.935
I don’t care if they are from this detective club or
what, but bringing them to this important meeting…

00:08:00.306 --> 00:08:00.739
Oh, is there some reason why you don’t
want guests here, Tomohiko-niisan?

00:08:01.373 --> 00:08:02.575
What did you say, Akihiko?

00:08:03.142 --> 00:08:07.179
I know that you’ll do anything to monopolize
mom’s inheritance too.

00:08:07.246 --> 00:08:09.748
Please stop, you two! In front of the guests!

00:08:12.651 --> 00:08:19.024
It seems that it'll be less troublesome for Kaoru-san
if we go as the detective club rather than as DDS.

00:08:19.391 --> 00:08:21.694
My! My! You siblings are so all undisciplined

00:08:22.228 --> 00:08:25.998
My sister will be crying in her grave
if you don’t stop, right, dear?

00:08:26.198 --> 00:08:27.766
Sachio’s right.

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.469
After her husband died, Hanyo-san...

00:08:30.569 --> 00:08:37.476
…raised you guys by herself while managing
a company with me for such a long time.

00:08:38.177 --> 00:08:42.681
The saddest thing for her to see would be
you children disputing over her fortune.

00:08:42.948 --> 00:08:48.387
He’s right. I can understand why my sister would
want to hand down her will from heaven.

00:08:49.188 --> 00:08:53.392
Surely, my sister isn't going to give
her inheritance to you boys.

00:08:53.792 --> 00:08:58.831
Yeah, if all of mom’s inheritance goes to
Kaoru whom she cared about the most…

00:08:59.398 --> 00:09:03.068
You’ll be getting all that money since
you will be Kaoru’s guardians, right?

00:09:03.802 --> 00:09:06.305
We’re not going to allow you
to have that satisfaction!

00:09:07.006 --> 00:09:08.073
What did you say?

00:09:09.708 --> 00:09:14.446
I see. This unsettling atmosphere is because
of the dispute over the inheritance.

00:09:14.780 --> 00:09:15.447
Seems so…

00:09:21.921 --> 00:09:25.424
Asakura Kousei-Sensei is waiting in the back room.

00:09:27.893 --> 00:09:29.461
Who’s that beauty?

00:09:29.995 --> 00:09:33.599
She’s Nabeshima Sayaka-san, my
mom’s presidential secretary.

00:09:33.599 --> 00:09:35.434
Wow!

00:09:35.434 --> 00:09:37.670
Ichinose’s mother was a company president?

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:40.339
How’s the company doing now?

00:09:41.040 --> 00:09:47.546
It’s doing well, thanks to the secretary Sayaka-san’s
management and my uncle’s cooperation.

00:09:47.780 --> 00:09:53.185
The company was near bankruptcy, but thanks
to moms life insurance money, it recovered.

00:09:53.619 --> 00:09:54.720
Akihiko-niisan!

00:09:55.854 --> 00:09:58.324
The company recovered from
the life insurance money?

00:09:59.091 --> 00:10:03.329
Being a president, she probably had her
life insured for at least a few billion.

00:10:03.963 --> 00:10:05.531
A f-few billion?

00:10:05.898 --> 00:10:08.167
Let’s postpone that conversation…

00:10:09.301 --> 00:10:11.270
Now, let’s proceed to the back room.

00:10:23.482 --> 00:10:25.618
So she's the medium...

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:28.454
Yeah, she’s Asakura Kousei-san.

00:10:31.523 --> 00:10:34.593
Asakura… Kousei…

00:10:37.496 --> 00:10:39.798
Huh? The search didn’t return any matches?

00:10:40.599 --> 00:10:44.670
A true medium doesn’t always
appear on the front stage.

00:10:45.404 --> 00:10:48.540
The only clients that Asakura-Sensei accepts are…

00:10:48.741 --> 00:10:53.846
…big shot members of the Diet or top executives
of blue-ribbon corporations.

00:10:54.279 --> 00:10:55.681
ls that how it is…

00:10:56.448 --> 00:10:59.952
She came unexpectedly to our
secretary, Sayaka-san…

00:11:00.152 --> 00:11:03.022
…with the letter of request in Mom’s handwriting.

00:11:03.689 --> 00:11:06.258
And she performed a seance in this room…

00:11:20.472 --> 00:11:25.644
We had just felt things in the room starting
to shake by themselves, when suddenly…

00:11:26.812 --> 00:11:27.746
Tomohiko…

00:11:28.447 --> 00:11:29.381
Akihiko…

00:11:30.249 --> 00:11:31.016
Kaoru…

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:32.785
Is that you, Mom?

00:11:33.218 --> 00:11:34.019
It can’t be!

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:37.156
I heard. You heard it, too, right?

00:11:39.658 --> 00:11:43.796
And then, we saw a notebook in
the middle of the room, and…

00:11:44.663 --> 00:11:48.534
There, we found Mom’s handwritten scribble.

00:11:49.968 --> 00:11:51.370
H-How scary!

00:11:52.104 --> 00:11:54.540
Well, it is a common way of doing it…

00:11:54.973 --> 00:11:57.476
Although you are talking tough,
you’re shivering, Kazuma.

00:11:57.776 --> 00:12:01.714
I-I'm not shivering! This must
be some kind of a trick!

00:12:02.414 --> 00:12:03.716
Kazuma’s right.

00:12:04.616 --> 00:12:09.455
There are many precedents that have proved
seances are just another type of stage magic.

00:12:10.589 --> 00:12:15.194
It is obvious that the medium is hiding some tricks…

00:12:15.494 --> 00:12:19.865
…to be used during the seance inside her thick
layer of clothing and that long muffler.

00:12:20.933 --> 00:12:26.505
Heh, now I see. Well, let’s unmask the true identity
of this ghost they’ve been talking about.

00:12:31.443 --> 00:12:34.847
Is this tape recorder and candle okay, Sensei?

00:12:39.384 --> 00:12:40.052
Who are you?

00:12:40.853 --> 00:12:45.624
We’re members of & detective club, and we
are interested in spiritualism and stuff so…

00:12:50.496 --> 00:12:54.066
I see, then, can you help me setup for the seance?

00:12:54.199 --> 00:12:55.934
O-Of course! With pleasure!

00:13:06.245 --> 00:13:07.412
Did you find any gimmicks?

00:13:07.980 --> 00:13:10.282
No. I haven’t found anything like that yet.

00:13:11.116 --> 00:13:11.917
Me neither.

00:13:12.317 --> 00:13:21.426
But that guy Fujisawa was going around doing final
checks so he might of have planted gimmicks then.

00:13:24.429 --> 00:13:25.497
Now, everyone.

00:13:26.431 --> 00:13:34.206
Please gather around Asakura-Sensei and form a
circle hand-in-hand with the person next to you.

00:13:37.676 --> 00:13:38.610
Please hold on a minute.

00:13:40.846 --> 00:13:43.882
Can you separate us members of the
detective club around the circle…

00:13:43.949 --> 00:13:46.084
…so that none of us are next to each other?

00:13:47.853 --> 00:13:49.321
So you’re skeptical?

00:13:50.022 --> 00:13:51.590
Believe that if you want.

00:13:52.424 --> 00:13:54.359
What should we do, Asakura-Sensei?

00:13:57.095 --> 00:13:59.832
But there are only five of you.

00:14:00.365 --> 00:14:04.036
If you include Kaoru-san in our group,
it'll be divided perfectly into six each.

00:14:14.980 --> 00:14:19.918
We will now recall the spirit of Ichinose Hanayo-san
who was killed in a plane crash.

00:14:20.986 --> 00:14:23.889
Please turn off the light and exit
the room, Ootaguro-san.

00:14:34.266 --> 00:14:35.868
When the flame on this candle is blown out…

00:14:35.934 --> 00:14:39.004
…Ichinose Hanayo-san’s spirit will
come down into the sensei’s body.

00:14:39.705 --> 00:14:45.777
Everyone, please hold each other’s hands
tightly so that the spirit won’t escape.

00:14:50.215 --> 00:14:52.050
Well then, please begin, Sensei.

00:14:57.956 --> 00:15:00.259
It’s pitch black! I can’t see anything!

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:04.596
Is everyone hand-in-hand with
the person next to you?

00:15:05.530 --> 00:15:11.970
Now, everyone, please slowly draw back
and enlarge the place within the circle.

00:15:21.480 --> 00:15:23.682
The spirit of Ichinose Hanayo…

00:15:24.049 --> 00:15:28.420
I ask you to return to this place and tell us where
you hid your will while in your lifetime.

00:15:36.795 --> 00:15:37.696
W-What are you doing?

00:15:41.199 --> 00:15:43.268
W-What was that voice?

00:15:43.735 --> 00:15:45.804
Can it be that my sister’s spirit is in pain?

00:15:46.271 --> 00:15:47.406
Hey, don’t talk!

00:15:49.574 --> 00:15:51.910
Please don’t move everyone.

00:15:52.144 --> 00:15:56.014
If it was really Mom’s spirit, I want her to come here.

00:15:56.281 --> 00:15:59.618
She’s right! Talking loudly will scare the spirit away!

00:16:00.319 --> 00:16:03.288
Please calm down, everyone! Sensei is okay!

00:16:03.722 --> 00:16:06.892
But this is a little different from last time!

00:16:07.526 --> 00:16:11.530
Fujisawa-san? Uhm, this is Kyuu talking,
can I ask you something?

00:16:12.130 --> 00:16:13.999
Yes. What is it, Kyuu-san?

00:16:14.599 --> 00:16:17.736
This seems very strange. Is she really okay?

00:16:18.036 --> 00:16:22.374
He’s right! The medium hasn’t said anything
after making that strange sound!

00:16:22.574 --> 00:16:26.244
Hey, forget about the spirit already
and let’s just quit this!

00:16:26.445 --> 00:16:29.948
Hey, it’s really strange! Turn on the light quickly!

00:16:30.716 --> 00:16:33.885
Wait, Kinta! Are you still hand-in-hand, Kyuu?

00:16:34.619 --> 00:16:35.587
Yeah, of course.

00:16:36.188 --> 00:16:36.655
How about you, Megu?

00:16:36.722 --> 00:16:37.789
I'm hand-in-hand!

00:16:38.256 --> 00:16:39.291
How about you, Kazuma and Kinta?

00:16:39.424 --> 00:16:40.892
I'm hand-in-hand!

00:16:41.193 --> 00:16:42.361
Me, too…

00:16:42.627 --> 00:16:44.363
Fujisawa-san, this is Amakusa talking.

00:16:45.297 --> 00:16:47.199
Please tell everyone to let go of each
other’s hand and turn on the light!

00:16:48.233 --> 00:16:49.501
In any case, this is strange!

00:16:50.168 --> 00:16:53.205
Yes… Well then you may let go
of each others hands now.

00:16:55.574 --> 00:16:56.608
Where’s the switch?

00:16:58.276 --> 00:16:59.211
I'm sorry!

00:16:59.277 --> 00:17:00.012
Watch out!

00:17:03.215 --> 00:17:04.349
Where the hack is the switch?

00:17:13.392 --> 00:17:15.060
A-Asakura-san’s dead!

00:17:17.329 --> 00:17:18.697
What could have happened?

00:17:19.231 --> 00:17:20.232
Oh my! This is…

00:17:20.999 --> 00:17:23.402
Please call the police immediately, Ootaguro-san!

00:17:23.969 --> 00:17:24.536
R-Right away!

00:17:24.970 --> 00:17:27.239
W-What the heck’s going on?

00:17:27.539 --> 00:17:28.206
Don’t move!

00:17:30.475 --> 00:17:33.779
Asakura-san has just now been
murdered by somebody.

00:17:35.080 --> 00:17:38.683
If the door had been opened, the light
from outside would have streamed in.

00:17:39.351 --> 00:17:41.920
But it was pitch black until we found her dead.

00:17:43.155 --> 00:17:50.529
That means the culprit who stabbed and murdered
Asakura Kousei-san is one of us here!

00:17:54.800 --> 00:17:56.168
Don’t be foolish.

00:17:57.102 --> 00:18:00.772
All twelve of us here were all hand-in-hand!

00:18:01.573 --> 00:18:05.310
How could it be possible for us to kill
Asakura-san who was in the middle?

00:18:06.311 --> 00:18:07.546
It must be the doing of the spirit.

00:18:07.879 --> 00:18:09.648
Hanayo-san’s spirit is in rage!

00:18:10.248 --> 00:18:11.216
Mom’s spirit?

00:18:11.983 --> 00:18:14.019
That can’t be… No…

00:18:14.719 --> 00:18:19.124
He’s right! It was my sister!
My sister’s spirit killed her!

00:18:37.143 --> 00:18:39.212
I'm Odajima from the department
of criminal investigations.

00:18:39.812 --> 00:18:42.348
N-Nice to meet you. I'm Ichinese Tomohiko.

00:18:42.415 --> 00:18:43.182
I'm Akihiko.

00:18:43.950 --> 00:18:48.621
I see. And the young lady back
there is your sister, Kaoru-san.

00:18:51.190 --> 00:18:51.924
Who are you guys?

00:18:52.759 --> 00:18:53.893
U-Uhm, we are…

00:18:55.294 --> 00:18:59.032
They are young mistress Kaoru’s
friends from the detective club.

00:19:01.834 --> 00:19:04.971
I don’t care if it’s a club or whatever,
this is a murder scene!

00:19:05.505 --> 00:19:08.441
You’ll get hurt if you’re thinking this is a kid’s game.

00:19:08.741 --> 00:19:09.409
Do you understand?

00:19:09.742 --> 00:19:10.777
Yes, sir.

00:19:11.944 --> 00:19:13.279
By the way, Mr. Detective!

00:19:13.279 --> 00:19:14.681
Huh?

00:19:14.681 --> 00:19:19.085
Around the victim, we were
all hand-in-hand in a circle.

00:19:19.786 --> 00:19:23.890
Estimating that we were all one meter apart from
each other, the circumference would be 12 meters…

00:19:24.257 --> 00:19:26.225
And so, the radius would be two meters long.

00:19:26.826 --> 00:19:31.798
That’s the distance between the victim and everyone
who was present at the time, Mr. Detective.

00:19:33.733 --> 00:19:36.803
But you can’t tell who was where in this picture.

00:19:37.336 --> 00:19:39.272
I remember that!

00:19:39.639 --> 00:19:40.073
What?

00:19:40.506 --> 00:19:44.544
Placing the eldest son Tomohika-san
at the 12 o’clock spot…

00:19:45.511 --> 00:19:51.017
Going clockwise: Kyuu, Aunt Kusaka
Sachio-san, Kaoru-san…

00:19:51.417 --> 00:19:57.023
Uncle Kusaka Shouhei-san, Kinta, the
second son Akihiko-san, Ryuu-kun…

00:19:58.091 --> 00:20:00.460
The secretary Nabeshima-san, and then Kazuma…

00:20:01.461 --> 00:20:06.499
Asakura-san’s assistant Fujisawa-san,
and me, Minami Megumi.

00:20:07.266 --> 00:20:10.403
Hey, how do you remember so accurately?

00:20:11.003 --> 00:20:12.238
You mustn’t lie!

00:20:12.505 --> 00:20:16.909
I'm not lying! I don’t forget anything
that comes before my eyes.

00:20:17.543 --> 00:20:19.612
It’s called photographic memory.

00:20:21.581 --> 00:20:23.349
I see that you are bunch of clever kids, but…

00:20:23.983 --> 00:20:28.321
If what you say is true, it's as
if the ghost is the culprit.

00:20:29.021 --> 00:20:30.389
That’s exactly right!

00:20:31.457 --> 00:20:35.628
That medium must have done something
that made the spirit mad!

00:20:35.862 --> 00:20:39.699
He’s right! My sister's spirit killed her!

00:20:40.199 --> 00:20:43.169
Stabbing her back with a knife in the dark…

00:20:43.169 --> 00:20:44.604
Stop, Aunt Sachio!

00:20:45.538 --> 00:20:49.976
Mom wouldn’t do something like that
even if she did become & ghost!

00:20:51.177 --> 00:20:52.011
Ichinose…

00:20:52.678 --> 00:20:54.547
Don’t you think so, nii-san?

00:20:55.515 --> 00:20:56.816
I wonder…

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:58.384
Tomohiko-niisan?

00:21:00.186 --> 00:21:06.392
Unlike you who was Mom’s favorite,
mom hated me and Akihiko.

00:21:06.993 --> 00:21:11.330
That’s right. We’re a burden to
the Ichinose family after all.

00:21:11.964 --> 00:21:13.666
Even Akihiko-niisan…

00:21:20.239 --> 00:21:21.774
Putting that aside…

00:21:22.608 --> 00:21:28.915
The fact that everybody inside was hand-in-hand
means the suspect must have been an outsider.

00:21:29.715 --> 00:21:30.850
That’s right, detective!

00:21:31.851 --> 00:21:35.288
The butler, Ootaguro-san was
outside during the seance!

00:21:36.489 --> 00:21:38.624
He’s the only person who could
have killed the Sensei!

00:21:39.025 --> 00:21:41.427
W-What are you talking about, Fujisawa-san?

00:21:42.161 --> 00:21:51.804
Everyone would notice immediately if I opened the
door since the light in the ball would stream in!

00:21:52.939 --> 00:21:57.210
You are rather more suspicious
since you are her assistant!

00:21:57.376 --> 00:21:58.211
What’s that?

00:21:58.945 --> 00:22:03.316
Am I wrong? You as the assistant
could have setup a trick.

00:22:03.449 --> 00:22:04.383
That’s enough!

00:22:05.218 --> 00:22:09.689
Let’s stop this unsightly dispute and
start thinking it through calmly.

00:22:11.224 --> 00:22:16.229
It’s true that everybody in the room was hand-in-
hand and wasn’t able to commit the crime, but…

00:22:16.929 --> 00:22:19.832
If you can’t use your hands,
how about using your legs?

00:22:19.832 --> 00:22:21.667
Legs?

00:22:21.667 --> 00:22:22.101
That’s right.

00:22:22.702 --> 00:22:27.673
Even if you can’t use your hands,
use your toes like this, and…

00:22:28.875 --> 00:22:29.976
Shoot!

00:22:32.578 --> 00:22:35.915
Oh, sorry! That didn’t work out so well.

00:22:36.148 --> 00:22:37.750
It damn well didn’t.

00:22:38.050 --> 00:22:43.055
Besides, you can’t aim accurately at the heart even
if you used your hands in that pitch dark room!

00:22:43.656 --> 00:22:46.125
There’s no other way than approaching
the victim and stabbing her!

00:22:46.525 --> 00:22:48.427
Won’t you be all covered in blood then?

00:22:49.862 --> 00:22:53.432
I don’t think you will get splattered with
blood with those thick layered clothes.

00:22:54.533 --> 00:23:00.907
Then that means the culprit planned this murder
knowing what the victim would wear?

00:23:01.607 --> 00:23:02.108
That’s right.

00:23:03.209 --> 00:23:05.278
This is a well-planned murder!

00:23:05.645 --> 00:23:06.512
Ryuu-kun…

00:23:19.158 --> 00:23:21.961
And the culprit is definitely one of us!

00:23:29.001 --> 00:23:32.838
Not a spirit, but an actual living culprit!

00:23:37.342 --> 00:23:40.549
The Sun is setting in a red glow...

00:23:41.115 --> 00:23:43.680
...as it follows me.

00:23:43.986 --> 00:23:46.849
Along this deserted beach...

00:23:46.852 --> 00:23:50.783
...I walk alone once more.

00:23:50.790 --> 00:23:54.165
I can't continue to hold in...

00:23:54.751 --> 00:23:57.149
...the tears that should pour out.

00:23:57.786 --> 00:24:00.253
Why have these memories...

00:24:00.263 --> 00:24:03.793
...become so wonderful?

00:24:04.337 --> 00:24:09.356
Ah... Like an ocean wave, I return to you...

00:24:09.606 --> 00:24:12.129
...because I'm so in love.

00:24:12.860 --> 00:24:15.846
And, now my heart...

00:24:15.851 --> 00:24:17.990
...is heavy with pain.

00:24:18.944 --> 00:24:21.884
Reflections of a bright rainbow...

00:24:21.936 --> 00:24:26.147
...shine on the distant shores of yesterday.

00:24:26.440 --> 00:24:30.118
I'll never forget those days...

00:24:30.125 --> 00:24:35.211
...and I long to see you again.

00:24:36.803 --> 00:24:39.239
What secret is written in the hidden will?

00:24:40.073 --> 00:24:44.144
What we see while searching for the will
is a sad dispute over the inheritance.

00:24:44.578 --> 00:24:47.047
And then, a second murder occurs in a closed room.

00:24:47.914 --> 00:24:51.752
From dues left at the crime scene, I discover
an unexpected truth about the case.

00:24:52.819 --> 00:24:53.887
There’s only one answer!

00:24:56.390 --> 00:24:57.524
But, sis!

00:24:58.025 --> 00:25:01.461
Kyuu drools big-time whenever he sees a cute girl!

00:25:02.029 --> 00:25:05.032
You’re always talking about this
Kyuu-kun recently, .

00:25:05.298 --> 00:25:07.401
T-That’s because I'm his classmate and…

00:25:07.467 --> 00:25:08.902
Do you want me to get your iris-colored panties?
